  "destination_prewarm": "Write and read back only an inverted RAM witness; device snapshot necessarily equals source because configuration is immutable. No device dirty-state claim.",
  "transport_boundary": "QTest OK is transport-only. Enabled accepted reads check the exact u32 0xf00b8 or little-endian bytes b8000f00 and absence of both model and generic rejection. Enabled rejected callbacks require one exact model log with no generic access-valid line. Disabled addresses and true holes require actual generic Invalid diagnostics; failed read numeric values are never interpreted. All probes require unchanged 17-field QOM state.",
  "dispatch_boundary": "Enabled valid/impl maximum 8 with impl.unaligned=true delivers typed 8-byte and unaligned 4-byte requests as one callback despite the 4-byte leaf. Raw 5-byte buffers deliver the 4-byte prefix then the unmapped byte at BASE+4. Read prefixes must be b8000f00; write prefixes are rejected as read-only. Default/off has no leaf, so unassigned maximum width 4 divides a qword at the four-byte-aligned BASE into two 4-byte generic rejections. No returned failed suffix, whole-buffer success, mutable prefix or atomicity is claimed.",
